00:55:38.180 --> 00:55:43.980
Actually Harry doing the Stone Stop the Carnival to the Democratic National Convention, a lot

00:55:43.980 --> 00:55:48.810
of young people probably don't remember their history. It was the most violent political

00:55:48.810 --> 00:55:54.150
convention in this century. I mean there was the yippies, there was police brutality,

00:55:54.150 --> 00:56:00.000
there was, I mean it was physically very, very volatile and very heavy. And it wasn't

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:05.640
It wasn't a compliment to the Democratic Party, it was to the political process we were making

00:56:05.640 --> 00:56:07.020
the comment about.

00:56:07.020 --> 00:56:12.540
So they took it out and sold the time to the Republican National Party for Richard Nixon's

00:56:12.540 --> 00:56:13.540
campaign.

00:56:13.540 --> 00:56:16.440
So they took it out and had Richard Nixon, who was not our friend, he was actually later

00:56:16.440 --> 00:56:19.080
on the guy who won the election and then fired us.

00:56:19.080 --> 00:56:20.860
It was to him that did it.

00:56:20.860 --> 00:56:23.500
So it was a combination of very ironic happenings.

00:56:23.500 --> 00:56:29.450
But this was kind of an indication, we didn't know it all, that this was the start of our

00:56:29.450 --> 00:56:30.000
Our last

00:56:30.510 --> 00:56:32.750
They were planning our death.

00:56:33.150 --> 00:56:37.450
I would rather have had the Smothers Brothers on the air for the length of time we had them saying something

00:56:37.450 --> 00:56:40.570
than to have had the Smothers Brothers on the air forever saying nothing.

00:56:41.590 --> 00:56:49.200
By that mere fact, they made an enormous contribution because they touched thousands and thousands of minds

00:56:49.200 --> 00:56:54.180
that I'm sure decided during the period of the Smothers Brothers show that they were not going to take any crap,

00:56:54.180 --> 00:56:59.830
that they were going to stay to the gun, that it was the honorable thing to do, the moral thing to do.

00:57:00.280 --> 00:57:06.890
And I think the Smothers Brothers, with all the difficulty that they experienced, must

00:57:06.890 --> 00:57:12.400
take great reward in the fact that they were the heroes of the time, and are in the minds

00:57:12.400 --> 00:57:14.700
of many of us still quite heroic.

00:57:14.700 --> 00:57:18.680
We hope this comedy hour brought back memories for some of you, and for others who were not

00:57:18.680 --> 00:57:23.340
around back then, maybe we showed you a little bit about what TV and the world were like

00:57:23.340 --> 00:57:27.760
in September 1968, particularly at the Chicago Convention.
